67:- Consumer state is written immediately after the dry-run return but before runtime/context materialization ([installer, lines 175–209](https://github.com/ivanopcode/cocoaskills/blob/6fc2fd97dbdf40f5b0e46f846eaa0d78a1b33d12/src/csk/installer.py#L175-L209)).
