512-
513-### 5.1 Why `skill + commit` is insufficient
514-
515-The current runtime key does not distinguish:
516-
517-- Go toolchain upgrades or patched distributions;
518-- OS/architecture/tuning changes;
519-- cgo/module/network policy revisions;
520-- driver semantic revisions;
521-- command/source selection;
522:- a corrupted or incomplete existing cache directory.
